/* Add-ons checkbox (OrderBits.tsx AddonRow): the unchecked tile is a hairline
   `border-rim-hi` / `bg-well` square, meant to read as "empty, tap to add".
   Both tokens sit too close to the card's own surface colour to read as a
   control at all — in dark mode `bg-well` (#000c1e) is nearly the same navy
   as the card behind it; in light mode the pale `border-rim-hi` measures
   ~1.6:1 against a white card, under the 3:1 WCAG floor for a UI boundary.
