   checkbox was there, not an unticked one. A real border plus a faint tint —
   in the same blue the checked state resolves to — makes "off" read as a
   control waiting to be ticked, in both themes, without competing with the
   filled "on" square beside it. Matched on the tile's own unique size+radius
   combo (no other checkbox in the app is 19px with a 5px radius) so this
   cannot bleed onto some other border-rim-hi/bg-well element. */
